    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταιθύσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wave</i> or <i>float down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκαμοι . . νῶτον καταίθυσσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.83
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδίαν ὃς καταιθύσσει ἑστίαν</span>
			<i>sheds</i> fair weather <i>down upon</i> the hearth, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.11
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταῖθυξ</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμβρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				216
			</span></i>.</div>
